  "instructions": [
    "Heat 1 tablespoon of vegetable oil in a large hot pot over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the chicken breast and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the red curry paste and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the red bell pepper and cook for 3-4 minutes, or until tender.",
    "Add the fish sauce, brown sugar, soy sauce, and score-fat. Stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and add the fish balls. Cook for 2-3 minutes, or until heated through.",
    "Add the chopped Thai basil and cook for an additional minute.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy!"
